<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TPN half year earnings slump, no div.</title>
<headline>TPN half year earnings slump, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 196</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     1.5	   vs 2.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs 1.4</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.74	  vs 1.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.22	  vs 1.83</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.48	  vs 0.66</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    -	    vs 0.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		  20.58	 vs 22.63</p>
<p>Full name: TPN Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - TPN said it was hit by extremely competitive conditions in the industrial fastener market. Conditions are expected to remain unchanged in the second half, making it prudent to waive the interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
